# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agentic AI & AI-Assisted Development with GitHub Copilot — 3-day outline
# Own repo since 2026-09-22: ghewaredevopsai/agentic-ai-copilot (PRIVATE).
#
# Everything tracked here is participant-facing. Keep trainer-only material
# out of it.
#
# This repo is SHARED WITH PARTICIPANTS and must be self-contained: no links
# to other course repos. The practice code repos participants clone
# (global-bank-*, askops) stay outside it by design. meridian-freight is
# out of scope. Trainer-only material lives in trainer-private/ (ignored).
#
# What IS tracked, deliberately — all of it participant-facing:
#   course-outline-*-onepager.html   the one-page outline (must stay exactly 1 A4 page)
#   README.md                        participant guide: the three days, setup, how to open the decks
#   presentation/, assets/           the decks and the deck engine
#   labs/                            lab guides and tickets
#   resources/                       learning-outcomes tracker, video resources
#
# The trainer README (lineage, decision log, render steps) is
# trainer-private/README-trainer.md, not this repo's README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

